{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1564","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"中国现当代文学是中国近现代社会变革的产物，它伴随着中国革命、建设和改革的洪流不断发展，用新的思想、新的语言、新的样式为中国文学开辟了新的天地。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元所选都是现当代文学中的优秀作品，有小说、诗歌、散文、戏剧，涵盖了新文学的主要体裁，体现了现当代文学创作的多方面成就。把这些作品集中起来研读，可以对现当代文学创作的概貌有个大致的了解，还可以加深对百年来中国社会变革与发展，特别是对人的心灵变化的认识。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"研习本单元，要结合特定的社会历史背景，理解作品的思想文化内涵，探索其中蕴含的民族心理和时代精神，了解百年来人们社会生活和情感世界变动的轨迹。要根据各种文学体裁不同的艺术表现方式，多角度、多层面探究作品的意蕴；注重对作品的个性化解读，获得鲜活的审美体验。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e7%ac%ac%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":112586,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/4/4ac91f5d65aebcf77e2d5773cbfc6e0c6601756d.jpeg","height":450,"id":"media-42327d6d25efb98e7262","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"88746c93067d2cceb257152cde5db1c6c30cdd9d69db0d8a232e10dbfc076981","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/4/4ac91f5d65aebcf77e2d5773cbfc6e0c6601756d.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":817}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10455,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/orig